  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat: Add interactive browser playground & guided tutorial by @pranshuparmar in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/212\n* feat: Landing polish: README fixes, contributor docs cleanup, mode-aware playground Reset by @pranshuparmar in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/213\n* feat: Add anonymous analytics via GoatCounter by @pranshuparmar in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/214\n* docs: Add llms.txt for LLM/agent-readable project summary by @abyworkings-coder in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/217\n* fix(install): create the bin directory before installing the binary by @Sharma-IT in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/221\n* feat: add Apple container runtime support by @OVELYB in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/211\n* fix(darwin): force LC_ALL=C for locale-sensitive ps invocations by @shuvamk in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/218\n* fix(windows): normalize localized listener states by @NgoQuocViet2001 in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/231\n* feat: support the LoongArch (loong64) architecture by @xuxiaowei-com-cn in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/234\n* fix(tui): honor CLI targets when launching interactive mode by @chiliec in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/238\n* fix(output): keep colors on terminals without bright ANSI support by @CJstate in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/239\n* fix(proc): stop ancestry at recycled parent PIDs by @aoright in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/226\n* fix(build): replace the symlinked root main.go with a real entry point by @CJstate in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/242\n* feat: v0.3.4 Main PR by @pranshuparmar in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/243\n\n## New Contributors\n* @abyworkings-coder made their first contribution in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull/217\n* @Sharma-IT made their first contribution in https://github.com/pranshuparmar/witr/pull